    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n3982" root="تفه" body-key="t">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَفِهٌ</span></b> : see <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَافِهٌ</span>. ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  Also <i>Insipid; tasteless;</i> and
so ↓ <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَافِهٌ</span></b> . (KL.) You say <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَطْعِمَةٌ تَفِهَةٌ</span> <i>Kinds of
food having no taste of sweetness,</i> or <i>of sourness,</i>
or <i>of bitterness;</i> and some include bread and
flesh-meat among these. (K.)

